Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.66,0:00:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,壞球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.40,0:00:07.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這球可惜了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.65,0:00:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.99,0:00:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.57,0:00:13.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很難捕到好球呢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.64,0:00:16.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平均速度估計也在80公里左右
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.41,0:00:18.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 你們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:21.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 貓貓們來了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:22.49,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,一邊去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.26,0:00:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暫停一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.28,0:00:24.95,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,別纏過來
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.04,0:00:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在那裡會被踩扁的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.04,0:00:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不要讓貓腳踩髒了神聖的操場嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.30,0:00:34.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹佐佐佐佐佐美
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.63,0:00:36.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是笹瀨川佐佐美!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.81,0:00:39.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女子壘球社的閃亮王牌
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同時還是校內第一美少女
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.67,0:00:43.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是在搞啥
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.45,0:00:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她就是鈴的宿命對手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.18,0:00:52.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所謂操場 是為朝著高遠目標揮灑汗水的運動員而存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:59.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是給你們這種漫無目的只會逗貓的人用的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.42,0:01:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們似乎還是有個參加比賽的目標的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.56,0:01:02.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.74,0:01:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽你這口氣根本沒把它當回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.31,0:01:06.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,確實沒當回事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.91,0:01:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們若是只在角落裡玩投捕球我還能忍
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.69,0:01:13.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過現在我已經忍無可忍了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.66,0:01:17.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們壘球社要在這裡訓練 你們趕緊滾蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.90,0:01:19.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不現實
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.36,0:01:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗鈴 你敢侮辱我們壘球社…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.73,0:01:27.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然敢蹭佐佐美大人的玉足
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,無禮之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.30,0:01:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手塚!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.57,0:01:35.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你沒事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.73,0:01:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恃強凌弱 不可原諒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.34,0:01:44.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歸根結底是因為你把貓帶進操場…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.92,0:01:49.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對決吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.11,0:01:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟鈴來個一擊定勝負
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:54.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你贏了我們就閃人
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.62,0:01:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過如果鈴贏了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.22,0:02:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就得為你的學妹們的行為道歉 然後乖乖回去各練各的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.65,0:02:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 沒問題
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本小姐根本不可能輸嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.22,0:02:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球 擊球手出局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.70,0:02:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.20,0:02:19.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剛才我只是在看你練投球而已
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.80,0:02:21.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦 都這個點了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次再對決吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.93,0:02:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐佐美大人!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 給我道歉
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:28.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,130公里…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.70,0:02:30.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧 什麼情況?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:32.82,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,乖 沒事了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貓咪被欺負就動了真格吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:35.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟火事場力差不多
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.74,0:02:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她真的很重視貓咪們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.97,0:02:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之我們給剛才那個魔球命個名吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不就是個直球嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.70,0:02:44.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,球中有貓魂嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.07,0:02:46.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就叫上旋喵速球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.30,0:02:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.60,0:02:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…用星星眼看我我也不知道該給你什麼反應
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:56.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴習得上旋喵速球!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.64,0:04:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右左
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:29.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.02,0:04:30.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.72,0:04:31.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,錯了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.90,0:04:32.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右左
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.13,0:04:34.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右左
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.54,0:04:35.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:36.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我出個易錯題吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.83,0:04:39.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔 你想挑戰嗎 手塚
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.57,0:04:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.47,0:04:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右左
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:43.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,右右…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:46.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上當了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下一個挑戰者
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:51.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是玩過了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:53.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還想和我玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.65,0:04:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撒嬌也沒用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:04:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒用…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:01.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你沒轍
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.94,0:05:02.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,溺愛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼嘛 是理樹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.91,0:05:07.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:09.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難得一見啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.70,0:05:11.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這回會是什麼內容呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.22,0:05:14.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不時送來的迷之信
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:16.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是第三封了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:20.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,寄信人是誰 目的何在 我們至今不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.08,0:05:26.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信上說如果我們完成了所有任務就告訴我們這個世界的秘密…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.43,0:05:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又要照上面說的做?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.84,0:05:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那個秘密很讓人在意嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.97,0:05:32.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次讓我們幹什麼呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.42,0:05:35.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,治好2-A 一號的相思病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.85,0:05:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好俗的指令…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.73,0:05:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 你懂什麼是相思病嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.25,0:05:45.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字面上是戀愛很麻…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.97,0:05:47.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻花?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.39,0:05:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是「麻煩」啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.31,0:05:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不對不對 就是指戀愛病啦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,病…是生病了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.27,0:05:56.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,2-A應該是指班級吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.52,0:05:58.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一號就是學號…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.15,0:06:00.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一號說的是男生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.31,0:06:01.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.23,0:06:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們待會兒去見見他吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.55,0:06:06.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去見陌生男生啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.26,0:06:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,來了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.31,0:06:14.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗同學和…直枝同學?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.27,0:06:16.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是2-A的一號嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.18,0:06:18.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呃 是…是我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.40,0:06:19.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫相川
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.97,0:06:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼 害老娘如此費事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.01,0:06:27.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為啥要用壞蛋語氣開頭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.26,0:06:28.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請問你們找我什麼事…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.98,0:06:31.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咱們都是2年級的 不必那麼拘謹
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.50,0:06:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK 說吧你們找我幹啥
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.66,0:06:36.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好惱火的語氣
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這種話不能說出來的啦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.62,0:06:43.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你目前患有…相思病!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.97,0:06:45.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你…你怎麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.14,0:06:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥都甭說了 我們明白
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.04,0:06:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經有明確證據了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:51.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才沒那回事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.71,0:06:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們聽誰說的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.08,0:06:54.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我們不能說
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.53,0:06:56.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人就是萬事通
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.60,0:06:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說吧 你啥症狀
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.92,0:07:00.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問這個幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.18,0:07:04.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們會治好你的病
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.96,0:07:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是傾述出來也多少會輕鬆點
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.50,0:07:09.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別擔心 我們會保密的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 你們別跟別人講哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.20,0:07:16.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我胸口很難過
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:17.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難過?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.31,0:07:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.10,0:07:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一看到她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.80,0:07:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸口就一陣絞痛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.04,0:07:23.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絞痛?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.24,0:07:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全沒法學習
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.23,0:07:29.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上課時心裡想的全是她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.11,0:07:32.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這可能是我的初戀
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.16,0:07:35.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方什麼來路?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.20,0:07:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她能文能武 還深得眾望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.30,0:07:43.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我根本配不上她
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.60,0:07:45.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼說呢 真遺憾哈
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.19,0:07:48.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,別喪氣啊 你又還沒告白…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告白什麼的…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.84,0:07:50.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.13,0:07:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是被甩了就太可悲了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗試前就放棄不會心有不甘嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.42,0:07:57.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話是這麼說…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她到底是誰啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.34,0:08:05.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也對 知道對方是誰我們也好提建議…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:06.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過你不願意說就算了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.80,0:08:11.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是笹…笹瀨川同學
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.67,0:08:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為啥突然說出這個名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.37,0:08:21.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你們問我了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.53,0:08:24.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我們沒有問你那貨的名字
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 你們確實問了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:27.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.52,0:08:28.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.67,0:08:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不 這就是說相川同學喜歡的就是笹瀨川同學啦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.39,0:08:40.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦～
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.31,0:08:44.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼!?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.76,0:08:49.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼情況 我做錯啥了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.71,0:08:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退後
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.80,0:08:52.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:54.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷靜思考
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.31,0:08:58.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是理樹 我越是冷靜思考就越覺得矛盾
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.97,0:09:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想啊 他說她能文能武 還深得眾望
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.81,0:09:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我認識的笹佐佐佐佐佐美根本不是這麼回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你也不要打破他的幻想啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們辦事的重點不是這個吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.83,0:09:16.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:17.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.17,0:09:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聽我說 你們挺配的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.11,0:09:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她身後不是總有幾個跟班嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.22,0:09:26.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得你有望加入進去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.85,0:09:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是說我們只能做朋友嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 大概更慘
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實 我和她認識
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我應該能幫你們牽線搭橋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:37.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹你怎麼也吃驚了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.85,0:09:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…你說呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.14,0:09:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想怎麼幫他們牽線搭橋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在開始想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.41,0:09:48.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.96,0:09:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.53,0:09:52.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬同學
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.11,0:09:54.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚上好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.60,0:09:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我準備在房間裡辦個茶會
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.64,0:10:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬願意的話就一起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.69,0:10:01.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.76,0:10:04.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去吧 應該能趁機問出不少情報
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.14,0:10:10.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小毬醬 我去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.43,0:10:12.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,耶 太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.49,0:10:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹也來嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.42,0:10:14.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊～
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.83,0:10:18.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我自己會吃啦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.11,0:10:20.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然這麼爽快地來了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.92,0:10:21.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意見嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.85,0:10:24.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我覺得這很值得慶幸
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.55,0:10:28.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想問問你們
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:29.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問啥問啥
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.05,0:10:30.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問什麼?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.08,0:10:32.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,儘管問吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.60,0:10:37.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…怎麼才能讓人兩情相悅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.63,0:10:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴醬有心上人了!?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.30,0:10:46.24,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,Love Love Spring來了的說
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.33,0:10:44.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,戀愛話題出現了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.77,0:10:46.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對方是誰 讓大姐姐我來…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.46,0:10:49.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我啦 我只是想知道讓人兩情相悅的方法…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.59,0:10:53.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直枝同學和恭介學長的羈絆很強
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.76,0:10:56.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,根本不用我們操心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:57.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好心會辦壞事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.30,0:10:59.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是啦!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.25,0:11:05.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了取下圖書館內的同一本書而伸出手
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.52,0:11:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喊著「遲到啦遲到啦」時在拐角撞到 好像就會萌生愛意了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.74,0:11:11.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太混沌了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.75,0:11:14.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹覺得怎麼做好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個嘛…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.47,0:11:21.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去問問她的喜好和理想類型吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.61,0:11:22.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.85,0:11:24.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是去告訴相川君啦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.03,0:11:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和自己喜歡的人有關的情報誰都會想知道吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.92,0:11:28.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.96,0:11:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棗鈴!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.32,0:11:32.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟蹤我幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.34,0:11:35.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先聲明 你可別指望再像上次那麼好運
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.84,0:11:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 話說你有什麼喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.32,0:11:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.90,0:11:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你週六都在忙什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問得超突然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.38,0:11:44.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問這些幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.33,0:11:47.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想借此愚弄我嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:48.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.17,0:11:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是想多瞭解瞭解你
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.63,0:11:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了走得更近…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.21,0:11:57.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞭解名為佐瀨瀨川佐佐美的女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.26,0:11:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好可惜
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.18,0:12:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你果然是在耍我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:03.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.90,0:12:05.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你問什麼來著
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.64,0:12:06.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜好和啥
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,週六都忙些什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.85,0:12:10.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有理想對象是怎樣的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.01,0:12:14.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外貌呀 性格呀 具體點
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.03,0:12:16.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我沒什麼喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.85,0:12:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,週六練壘球
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.02,0:12:20.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理想男士是…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.73,0:12:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,劍道部的宮澤大人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.55,0:12:25.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.36,0:12:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣渣美喜歡謙吾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.75,0:12:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得考慮下怎麼告訴相川君了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.50,0:12:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之先去問問謙吾怎麼看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.30,0:12:39.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,噗 這個我還真沒想到
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.54,0:12:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.86,0:12:43.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就這麼回事 你怎麼看
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這我該怎麼答啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.30,0:12:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先說下你是否認識笹瀨川同學吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.15,0:12:49.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算認識吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.56,0:12:54.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在走廊擦身而過的次數多到不自然 而且她每次都跟我打招呼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:57.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 原來她有在努力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.39,0:12:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.64,0:13:02.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要怎麼回答你們才滿意?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.30,0:13:04.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,當然是「我對她沒興趣」了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.78,0:13:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我對她沒興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.84,0:13:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滿意了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.78,0:13:11.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾對她沒興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宮澤同學怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.40,0:13:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實笹瀨川同學她…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜歡謙吾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:22.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎麼了 貌似受到不小打擊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.43,0:13:24.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還是說只是身體不適?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.68,0:13:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對是前者
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.71,0:13:27.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太誇張了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.77,0:13:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾對她沒興趣 這可是良機啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:32.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,良機?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.50,0:13:38.06,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,魅力
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.92,0:13:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 謙吾的魅力何在
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:37.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先要認清這點
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:38.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.39,0:13:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾個頭大很可怕 也不和善
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.94,0:13:41.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過他很強
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.03,0:13:43.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他的魅力在於其強大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.10,0:13:46.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…如果你是在說他有男子氣概的話就算沒錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.74,0:13:47.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打倒謙吾吧!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.83,0:13:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,奇思妙想啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:54.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要在渣渣美面前打倒強大的謙吾 她肯定會愛上你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.71,0:13:58.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是我沒在搞體育運動 絕對贏不了的說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.26,Comment,NTP,0,0,0,,喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:03.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就從共同喜好上下手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.89,0:14:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹瀨川同學不是沒什麼喜好嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.21,0:14:08.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提出某種可能共有的項目就行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.51,0:14:10.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你啥喜好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.64,0:14:13.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漫畫啦 遊戲啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.48,0:14:15.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,貌似沒戲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.37,0:14:16.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,音樂方面呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.98,0:14:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有沒有什麼經常聽的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:20.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘻哈的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,台式機?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.18,0:14:24.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那啥 你只說對了一個音啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘗試把喜歡的CD借她吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接就借CD了?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.81,0:14:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難度太高了啦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.46,0:14:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就唱一首
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.48,0:14:35.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在原創歌詞裡混入對渣渣美的戀慕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.68,0:14:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最後一句記住了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.29,0:14:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 「笹瀨川佐佐美 是你」
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.53,0:14:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:45.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務開始!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.57,0:14:47.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Hey Yo Hey Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:49.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Yo Yo Come On!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:51.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Check It Out Yo! Check It Out Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.33,0:14:52.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹瀨川 你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.36,0:14:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蟬
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.02,0:14:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然咬舌頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.39,0:15:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你誠心找茬嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:02.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 不是…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.10,0:15:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人家唱錯了嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:04.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.80,0:15:07.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還能挽救
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.37,0:15:09.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去打倒謙吾吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.86,0:15:10.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.87,0:15:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了我贏不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.88,0:15:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 要贏只能靠偷襲了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.51,0:15:16.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手段雖然卑鄙 但也無可奈何
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.61,0:15:19.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,偷襲我感覺也贏不了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.84,0:15:22.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就偷襲X3
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.47,0:15:23.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,X3?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.65,0:15:28.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先 我假裝跌倒 滑入謙吾腳下
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:32.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾肯定會跳起來避開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.41,0:15:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然後理樹喊一句「您的A套餐」
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.28,0:15:37.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝著謙吾的後腦勺扔餐盤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.98,0:15:40.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後謙吾肯定會低下頭縮成一團
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:45.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就趁機大喊「宮澤謙吾 我拿下了!」並給他一腳
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.44,0:15:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,踢中了感覺也不會有效果
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.02,0:15:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仗著慣性全力踢上去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,助跑200米過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.54,0:15:55.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好長的走廊啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.29,0:15:56.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是讓我撞他咯
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 對方根本沒地方躲嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.94,0:16:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要慣性大他肯定會被撞飛
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.78,0:16:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾被撞飛的鏡頭可謂少見
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.82,0:16:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,視覺衝擊力肯定很強
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.52,0:16:13.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定會成為傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.11,0:16:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣渣美 就位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.73,0:16:20.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.38,0:16:22.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謙吾 就位
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任務開始
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.91,0:16:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危險 讓開!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.60,0:16:31.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您的A套餐!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.19,0:16:34.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相川君 別去!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.98,0:16:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,宮澤謙吾 我拿下了!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.13,0:16:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 新玩法?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.36,0:16:49.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.47,0:16:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是恭介的主意啊 真傷腦筋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.33,0:16:55.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有賊人嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.59,0:16:58.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 是剛才那個無禮之徒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.72,0:17:00.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我全都看見了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.62,0:17:02.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不愧是宮澤大人
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.16,0:17:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊不 宮澤同學
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…抱歉了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次我會好好計劃的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.25,0:17:15.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夠了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.21,0:17:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啥意思…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.44,0:17:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不幹了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.68,0:17:21.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝你們為我做的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要放棄嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.70,0:17:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.96,0:17:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴 你萌生過戀情嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:35.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,問得有夠突然啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.97,0:17:41.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我覺得我們把這個問題看得太簡單是由於我們沒有經驗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.40,0:17:44.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,談戀愛不幸福嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.06,0:17:46.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肯定比我們想像中要痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:48.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相思病
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.06,0:17:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如其名 就跟真病一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.58,0:17:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他會怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.09,0:17:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即便想放棄卻忍不住百般猶豫 一直痛苦下去
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.94,0:18:01.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.76,0:18:03.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好痛苦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.68,0:18:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這次的指令是什麼來著?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.14,0:18:11.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,「治好相思病」
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.36,0:18:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,字面上並沒讓我們幫他成就戀情
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.58,0:18:19.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要強行撮合他們 只要消除他單相思的苦楚就行了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.80,0:18:22.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹 我去去就回
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.81,0:18:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來糾纏我 你到底想怎麼樣
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.24,0:18:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.49,0:18:38.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯…錯全在我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.94,0:18:41.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括那個無禮之徒?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.44,0:18:42.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我希望你能原諒他
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.96,0:18:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事實如此的話 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:51.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有 能…能不能把你的郵箱告訴我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.96,0:18:52.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這又是為什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.06,0:18:55.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,難不成想跟我做朋友?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.56,0:18:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我 是有個想交你這個朋友的人…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.17,0:19:02.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就讓他本人來找我要啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.14,0:19:07.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他似乎看到你胸口就會絞痛
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:13.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整日惦記著你 完全沒法學習
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.16,0:19:14.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他開不了口
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.99,0:19:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說實話這種事我根本不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.18,0:19:22.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只知道他似乎很痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹佐…佐渣…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.82,0:19:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹瀨川佐佐美!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.70,0:19:32.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你了!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:35.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關我鳥事
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.28,0:19:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.32,0:19:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸口難受
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.35,0:19:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種心情我能理解
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:47.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你等著 我去把手機拿來
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.87,0:19:49.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,渣渣是川渣渣美!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.01,0:19:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是笹瀨川佐佐美!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.24,0:19:56.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是佐佐美的郵箱
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:59.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過 一天只准發一封
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.99,0:20:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,關係有進展才能多發
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.91,0:20:06.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,還有寫郵件以外的時間盡量別去想她
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.31,0:20:08.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,學習也別落下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:09.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白了沒
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.62,0:20:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣算解決了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.10,0:20:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看他了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.29,0:20:25.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過鈴能做的已經都做了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.50,0:20:27.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我覺得這樣就好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.54,0:20:29.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.70,0:20:37.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鈴會有喜歡上某人的一天嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.70,0:20:42.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.08,0:20:43.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狀態不錯哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.21,0:20:45.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過速度變回去了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.48,0:20:47.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再把貓…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.95,0:20:50.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恃強凌弱 雖遠必誅!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.97,0:20:53.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我還啥都沒幹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.19,0:20:55.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,笹佐川佐佐美
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.78,0:20:56.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是笹瀨佐…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.08,0:20:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是笹瀨川佐佐美
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.27,0:21:00.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己都咬舌頭了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.19,0:21:03.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼 又來搗蛋?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.48,0:21:04.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 今天…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.99,0:21:08.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有件事想問…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:09.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.81,0:21:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能不能告訴我宮澤大人喜歡吃什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.24,0:21:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那小子真受歡迎啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.12,0:21:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說「不去開水的速食炒麵」
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.00,0:21:21.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去開水的速食炒麵
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.67,0:21:26.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不去開水這點好環保啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.91,0:21:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然接受了!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.53,0:21:30.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃起來是什麼味道呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.44,0:21:32.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也吃過嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.92,0:21:35.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒吃過 而且這根本就是真人瞎說的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.40,0:21:39.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又來了 耍我就這麼好玩嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.60,0:21:43.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 今天我絕對要讓你再也耍不了貧嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.72,0:21:46.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個 給我上!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.20,0:21:47.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接招
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.28,0:21:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(424,433)\fs27}很痛耶 吃招!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.56,0:21:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又開始了…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第20話\N治好相思病
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:07.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第20話\N治好相思病
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.71,0:22:07.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,600)\bord0\pos(425,370)\blur1}第20話\N治好相思病
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.91,0:23:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流星之夜 我碰巧見證了庫特的迷之儀式
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.76,0:23:34.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理樹看到過南十字星嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.49,0:23:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們還未瞭解的庫特的秘密逐漸揭曉
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
