Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.88,0:04:04.81,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}きみの声忘れない　涙も忘れない
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.93,0:04:11.89,OP1,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\an5\pos(424,458)\bord4\be8\1a&HFF&\3a&H33&\3c&H68ADF9&}これから始まる　希望という名の未来を
